ADMIRAL64 - RELEASE V2

FIXED 32-BIT INTEGERS
  SIGNED, STORED INLINE IN HANDLE.
  RANGE -2^31 .. 2^31 - 1; WRAPS.

NATIVE CODE EXTENSIONS
  CODE("\xNN...") HOLDS RELOCATABLE
  6510 MACHINE CODE ON THE HEAP.
  UP TO 5 ARG HANDLES IN,
  16-BIT RESULT IN W0.

GRAPHICS HEAP (EXPERIMENTAL)
  BITMAP(TRUE) RESERVES TOP 9 KB
  FOR A VIC BITMAP PLANE.
  BITMAP(FALSE) RESTORES TEXT.

HIRES + MULTICOLOR LIBRARIES
  H = LOAD("HIRES")  320x200 MONO
  M = LOAD("MC")     160x200 MC
  SHOW CLEAR COLOR PLOT DRAW TEXT
  ALL NATIVE 6510 - SEE EXTENSIONS.MD.
